{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04615","headline":"赠崔二安平公乐世词 · 张说","name":"赠崔二安平公乐世词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五红粧侍绮楼，朝承握槊夜藏钩。\n君臣一意金门宠，兄弟双飞玉殿游。\n宁知宿昔恩华乐，变作潇湘离别愁。\n地湿莓苔生舞袖，江声怨叹入箜篌。\n自怜京兆双眉妩，会待南来五马留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}